{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43541","headline":"酒语联句各分一字 · 严维","name":"酒语联句各分一字","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"山简酣歌倒接㒿，看朱成碧无所知。\n耳鸣目眩驷马驰，口称童羖腹鸱夷。\n兀然落帽灌酒巵，太常吏部相对时。\n藉糟枕麴浮酒池，瓮间篱下卧不移。\n叫呼不应无事悲，千日一醒知是谁。\n左倾右倒人避之。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"严维","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_43541.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43541","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}